{"product_id":"pillow-thoughts-ii-healing-the-heart","title":"Pillow Thoughts II: Healing the Heart","description":"\u003cp\u003eFollowing the smash success of her best-selling book, Pillow Thoughts, Courtney Peppernell returns with the follow-up sequel Pillow Thoughts II: Healing the Heart.Courtney Peppernell understands that healing is a process, and Pillow Thoughts II--second in the Pillow Thoughts series--eloquently captures the time and experience that one goes through on their journey to peace through restoration.A collection of inspirational and comforting poems for anyone who is mending from a broken heart.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Courtney Peppernell\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781449495084\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45538588491929,"sku":"7RF9781449495084","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/686bf36e436c4_Pillow_Thoughts_II-_Healing_the_Heart_Courtney_Peppernell.jpg?v=1751910318","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/pillow-thoughts-ii-healing-the-heart","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}